<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="text-align: center;"><b style=""><font style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);" size="4" color="#006600">**ACUSE RECIBIDO**</font></b></div>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Estimado Equipo de <b>Pagos, Facturación y Operaciones</b> para este Shipment&nbsp; ha sido&nbsp; confirmado la Recepción del Acuse</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">.</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Favor de confirmar </b><font face="arial"><b>Recepción</b></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;de esta Solicitud y continuar con el seguimiento.</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Estatus actual:</b>&nbsp;</span></font><font color="#006600" face="arial">{!Shipment__c.Shipment_Status_Mon__c}</font></div><div style=""><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Shipment:</b>&nbsp;</span><font face="arial">{!Shipment__c.Name}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Cliente</b>:&nbsp;</span><font face="arial">{!Shipment__c.Account_for__c}</font></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Route</b>:&nbsp;{!Shipment__c.Route__c}</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Proveedor</b>:&nbsp;{!Shipment__c.Carrier__c}</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Acuse</b>:&nbsp;</font><font color="#333333" face="arial" style="font-size: medium;">{!Shipment__c.Tipo_de_Acuse__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Planner:</b>&nbsp;{!Shipment__c.Operation_Executive__c}</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Verify Pak Control:</b>&nbsp;</span><font color="#006600" face="arial"><b>{!Shipment__c.VERIFY_PAK_CONTROL__c}</b></font></div><div style=""><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><u>Comentarios</u>:</b>&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Shipment__c.Status_Observations__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style=""><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
